+# JARVIS Voice/TTS Hardening changeset
+
+Date: 2026-08-17
+
+## Root cause evidence
+
+The pre-change runtime probe for `Error 455` returned:
+
+```json
+{
+  "unsafe_before": false,
+  "sanitized_before": "Error 455",
+  "selected_provider": "piper",
+  "selected_voice": "jarvis-medium",
+  "selected_language": "en"
+}
+```
+
+`config/settings.json` selected `data/models/piper/jarvis-medium.onnx`.
+`PiperTTS._select_voice` inferred language from Cyrillic presence, so a raw
+ASCII error selected the local English voice. Runtime logs independently show
+Piper loading `jarvis-medium` and `ru_RU-dmitri-medium`. Production frontend
+sources contain no browser `SpeechSynthesis`; Windows `winsound` only played
+the WAV generated by Piper.
+
+## Changed files
+
+- `config/settings.py` — typed provider/language/voice/fallback/mode settings.
+- `config/settings.example.json` — Russian local Piper example configuration.
+- `config/settings.json` — local runtime selection changed to Dmitri Russian.
+- `core/voice/output.py` — `AssistantOutput`, `ErrorInfo`, categorical mapper.
+- `core/voice/speech_renderer.py` — speech-only rendering and personality modes.
+- `core/voice/tts_sanitizer.py` — final technical-payload barrier.
+- `core/voice/tts.py` — config-driven Russian-only Piper selection and WAV API.
+- `core/voice/tts_queue.py` — typed queue boundary and legacy input filtering.
+- `core/voice/__init__.py` — public voice contract exports.
+- `core/orchestrator.py` — typed response construction and single TTS path.
+- `core/state.py` — persisted/transportable `assistant_output` field.
+- `core/ws_server.py` — typed Developer Mode event; raw WS errors stay silent.
+- `tests/test_voice_hardening.py` — 34 new voice regression scenarios.
+- `tests/test_p1_sprint.py` — old sanitizer expectation updated to silence.
+- `scripts/voice_hardening_smoke.py` — real local Piper smoke and WAV verification.
+- `scripts/rollback_voice_hardening.ps1` — guarded commit-level rollback.
+
+Capability Planner, DesiredStateVerifier, learning, Windows/browser providers
+and Shadow Engine were not modified by this sprint.
+
+## After pipeline
+
+```text
+AgentOutcome
+  -> AssistantOutput(display/speech/debug/error)
+  -> SpeechRenderer
+  -> defense-in-depth sanitizer
+  -> TTSQueue(RenderedSpeech)
+  -> local Russian Piper
+  -> WAV/audio
+```
+
+## Fallback policy
+
+Primary provider is local Piper, language `ru`, voice
+`ru_RU-dmitri-medium`, configured fallback `none`. An incompatible English
+voice is never selected. A TTS failure leaves `display_text` available and
+produces no speech.
+
+## Dirty-worktree note
+
+The workspace already contained extensive uncommitted Sprint 1–9 work before
+this sprint. The delivery patch is therefore labelled workspace-vs-HEAD.
+Rollback is commit-based so unrelated working changes are not overwritten.
